'''Wall Doge''' (カベわんこ, ''Kabe Wanko'', '''Wall Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wall Doge
|image = E 117.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Monkey Magic|Sub-chapter 20 - Monkey Magic]]
|money drop = 200¢ - 790¢
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Theheckareyou Island|Sub-chapter 5 - Theheckareyou Island]]
}}

==Enemy==
Wall Doge is similar to [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]. However, she has more attack power and health. Spawned in groups to protect stronger enemies, just like how Wall Cat is used.

==Strategy==
Use any high DPS unit like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], just to name a few. On some stages, you can use her as a stepping stone to snipe backline enemies with [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]]/[[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] units, because of her high HP and low DPS.

Later on, she acts sort of like free money, since her impact on the field is very minuscule, because she will absolutely get crushed by your units by then, which would be far stronger than what you've got when you first met her.

